# Colang Guardrails Definition for SAATHI BIS Assistant

define user ask general question
  "What is the standard for cement?"
  "Tell me about IS 10500"
  "How do I apply for ISI mark?"
  "What are the permissible limits of lead in drinking water?"

define flow self check facts
  $relevant_chunks = execute retrieve_m3_context()
  $is_supported = execute check_facts_against_context(context=$relevant_chunks, response=$bot_response)

  if not $is_supported
    bot decline to x3 escalation
    stop

define flow self check hallucination
  $relevant_chunks = execute retrieve_m3_context()
  $has_hallucination = execute check_hallucination_against_context(context=$relevant_chunks, response=$bot_response)

  if $has_hallucination
    bot decline to x3 escalation
    stop

define bot decline to x3 escalation
  "I don't have enough verified context from official BIS standards to answer this query with high certainty. Rather than providing an inaccurate response, I have routed this query to our BIS technical desk (X3 Escalation). You can also reach the BIS helpdesk at https://www.bis.gov.in or call 011-23230131 for official clarification."

define flow generate answer with grounding
  user ...
  $bot_response = execute generate_rag_answer(query=$last_user_message)
  bot $bot_response
